{"ID":"20240504154352-z8sxg99","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154352-z8sxg99","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154352-z8sxg99\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617160517-z8kkt4y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606175514-e0h8xid\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617160517-z8kkt4y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"014白石英","updated":"20240617165248"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240617160517-z8kkt4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617160517-z8kkt4y","updated":"20240617165230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617160517-uob8h1e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617164053-yi5gi8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617164053-yi5gi8y","updated":"20240617164053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617164053-g6xrvow.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240617165231-w12qjnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617165231-w12qjnn","updated":"20240617165248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617165248-gyzm3mt.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614155842-ivgupyt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155842-ivgupyt"}},{"ID":"20240614160001-nl5byar","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-nl5byar","updated":"20240614160006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160001-0i6m73c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-0i6m73c","updated":"20240614160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160001-6yl129p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-6yl129p","updated":"20240614160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主消渴，阴痿，不足，咳逆（《御览》引作呕），胸鬲间久寒，益气，除风湿痹（《御览》引作阴淫痹）。久服，轻身（《御览》引作身轻健），长年。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160001-khmtqpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-khmtqpy","updated":"20240614160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：白石英，神农甘，岐伯黄帝雷公扁鹊无毒，生太山，形如紫石英，白泽，长者二三寸，采无时（《御览》引云，久服，通日月光）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160001-9g0en3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-9g0en3i","updated":"20240614160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生华阴及太山。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160001-8feoi2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160001-8feoi2q","updated":"20240614160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《司马相如赋》，有白附，苏林云白附，白石英也，司马山云，出鲁阳山。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160010-kmzmtx3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160010-kmzmtx3"}},{"ID":"20240614160022-ageedus","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160022-ageedus","updated":"20240614160025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160022-i56fg3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160022-i56fg3h","updated":"20240614160022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英味甘辛温，止咳暖胸住渴烦，疗肺痿痈除诸痹，利水强阴定魄魂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160022-fw9dwsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160022-fw9dwsx","updated":"20240614160022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石色白而有英华。无毒。暖胸膈者，胸膈久寒也。兼治风寒湿痹，利小便，补五脏。大如指长二三寸，六面如削，白彻光亮者上。有五色，惟白，紫二石入药。火 醋淬七次，水飞用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160034-y5qt0i0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160034-y5qt0i0"}},{"ID":"20240614160035-2sd203c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160035-2sd203c","updated":"20240614160039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160035-1ut7qt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160035-1ut7qt4","updated":"20240614160035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，无毒．主治肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏，通日月光．久服耐寒热．生华阴山．大如指，长二、三寸，六面如削，白澈有光．其黄端白棱名黄石英，赤端名赤石端名青石英，黑端名黑石英．二月采，亦无时．"}]},{"ID":"20240614160035-5t7zqjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160035-5t7zqjp","updated":"20240614160044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶白石英，味甘，微温．主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹．久服轻身，长年。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160051-sjvppop","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160051-sjvppop"}},{"ID":"20240614160052-hy8ka7k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-hy8ka7k","updated":"20240614160057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160052-88qbiid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-88qbiid","updated":"20240614160052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、辛，微温，无毒。主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹疗肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏，通日月光。久服轻身长年，耐寒热。生华阴山谷及泰山。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160052-7ngld36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-7ngld36","updated":"20240614160052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大端名青陶隐居云∶今医家用新安所出，极细长白澈者；寿阳八公山多大者，不正用之。《仙经》大小并有用，唯须精白无瑕杂者。如此说，则大者为佳。其四色英，今不复用。唐本注云∶白石英所在皆有，今泽州、虢州、洛州山中俱出，虢州者大，径三、四寸，长五、六寸。今通以泽州者为胜也。臣禹锡等谨按吴氏云∶白石英，神农∶甘。歧伯、黄帝、雷公、扁鹊∶无。生太山，形如紫石英。白泽，长者二、三寸。采无时。又云∶青石英如白石英，青端赤后者是。赤石英，赤端白后者是。赤泽有光，味苦。补心气。黄石英，黄色如金在端者是。黑石英，黑泽有光。药性论云∶白石英，君。能治肺痈，吐脓，治嗽逆上气，疸黄。日华子云∶五色石英，平。治心腹邪气，女人心腹痛，镇心，疗胃冷气，益毛发，悦颜色，治惊悸，安魂定魄，壮阳道，下乳，通亮者为上。其补益随脏色而治，青者治肝，赤者治心，黄者治皮肤，白者治肺，黑者治肾。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160052-lva9b9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-lva9b9q","updated":"20240614160052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶白石英，生华阴山谷及泰山。陶隐居以新安出者佳。苏恭以泽州者为胜。今亦泽州出焉。大抵长而白泽，明澈有光，六面如削者可用。长五、六寸者弥佳。其黄色如金在端者，名黄石英。赤端白后者，名赤石英。青端赤后者，名青石英。黑泽而有光者，名黑石英。二月采，亦云无时。古人服食，唯白石英为重，紫石英但入五石散。其黄、赤、青、黑四种，《本经》虽有名，而方家都不见用者。故《乳石论》以钟乳为乳，以白石英为石，是六英之贵者，唯白石也。又曰∶乳者，阳中之阴；石者，阴中之阳，故阳生十一月后甲子服乳，阴生五月后甲子服石。然而相反、畏恶，动则为害不浅。故乳石之发，方治虽多，而罕有能济者，诚不可轻饵也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160052-pqjokgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-pqjokgs","updated":"20240614160052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣惠方∶治腹坚胀满号石水方∶用白石英十两，捶如大豆大，以瓷瓶盛，用好酒二斗浸，以泥重封瓶口，将马粪及糠火烧之，长令酒小沸，从卯至午即住火，候次日，暖一中盏饮，日可三度。如吃酒少，随性饮之。其白石英，可更一度烧之。简要济众方∶治心脏不安，惊悸善忘，上鬲风热化痰。白石英一两，朱砂一两，同研为散。每服半钱，食后、夜卧前，金银汤调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160052-asqrr91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160052-asqrr91","updated":"20240614160052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶白石英，状如紫石英，但差大而六棱，白色如水精。紫、白二石英，当攻疾，可暂煮汁用，未闻久服之益。张仲景之意，只令 咀，不为细末者，岂无意焉。其久服，更宜详审。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160103-o4o39kl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160103-o4o39kl"}},{"ID":"20240614160104-loohvcx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-loohvcx","updated":"20240614160108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160104-8b7d426","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-8b7d426","updated":"20240614160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」甘、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160104-wcseqb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-wcseqb8","updated":"20240614160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614160104-xmr5i94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-xmr5i94","updated":"20240614160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、风虚冷痹，肾虚耳聋。取磁石五两，经火煅、醋淬各五次，加白石英五两，装入绢袋，浸一升酒中，过五、六天后，分次温取。酒尽，可再添酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160104-xc1rec8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-xc1rec8","updated":"20240614160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、惊悸善忘（上隔风热，心脏不安，宜化痰安神）。用白石英一两、朱砂一两，共研细。饭后煎金银汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160104-9f2x2eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160104-9f2x2eo","updated":"20240614160104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、石水肿坚（按：病象是四肢瘦，肚子大，腹水胀如坚石）。用白石英十两，捶成豆子大，装入瓷瓶，浸酒二斗瓶口泥封，周围以马粪和糠火烧之，常令小沸。约六小时后停火。第二天开始服用，每次服酒大半杯。一天三次，酒尽后，可再加酒如上法烧一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160113-dcjwz8m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160113-dcjwz8m"}},{"ID":"20240614160115-6uwm5o1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160115-6uwm5o1","updated":"20240614160119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160115-37vkvhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160115-37vkvhh","updated":"20240614160115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘辛，微温，无毒。主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹。疗肺痿下气，利小便，补五脏，通日月光。久服轻身，长年耐寒热。生华阴山谷，及太山，大如指，长二三寸。六面如削，白澈有光，其黄端白棱名黄石英，赤端名赤石英，青端名青石英，黑端名黑石英。二月采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160115-ernjyfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160115-ernjyfe","updated":"20240614160115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青石、赤石、黄石、白石、黑石脂等∶味甘，平。主黄胆，泻痢，肠， 脓血，阴蚀下血，赤白，邪气，痈肿疽痔，恶疮，头疡，疥瘙。久服，补髓益气，肥健不饥，轻身延年，五石脂各随其色，补五脏。生南山之阳山谷中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160123-ak8pnl4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160123-ak8pnl4"}},{"ID":"20240614160124-qa7fksj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160124-qa7fksj","updated":"20240614160128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160124-izl99yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160124-izl99yl","updated":"20240614160124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"重、润肺．"}]},{"ID":"20240614160124-zj0ppi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160124-zj0ppi0","updated":"20240614160124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温．润以去燥．（十剂曰∶湿可去枯、白石英紫石英之属是也．）利小便．实大肠．"}]},{"ID":"20240614160124-oqmnz65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160124-oqmnz65","updated":"20240614160124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治肺痿吐脓．咳逆上气．石药终燥．只可暂用．（润药颇多、而徐之才取二石英为润剂、存其意可也．）白如水晶者良．"}]},{"ID":"20240614160137-7jmzovw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160137-7jmzovw"}},{"ID":"20240614160138-lemrfbg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160138-lemrfbg","updated":"20240614160142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160138-vxgjqbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160138-vxgjqbo","updated":"20240614160138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出华阴山谷及泰山。虢州雒州亦有。近取泽州者为胜。大如指。六棱如削。白澈有光。长五六寸者弥佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160138-funmxdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160138-funmxdb","updated":"20240614160138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘辛。气微温。手太阴阳明气分药。主消渴。阴痿不足。治胸膈间久寒。益气。除风湿痹。补五脏。下气。疗肺痿并肺痈吐脓。咳逆上气。实大肠。治喘咳嗽血。（诸本草）湿可去枯。紫白石英之类是也。（藏器）色相莹如华萼。质可入肾。色可入肺。中含火气可逐寒。故主肾气不周于胸而消渴。天癸枯竭而阴痿不足。肺不容平而咳逆上气。气无帅制而痹闭不舒。火失修容而胸膈久寒等证。（子由）风虚冷痹。肾虚耳聋。益精保神。治诸阳不足。白石英三两。火。酒淬三次。瓶中密封。弗泄气。每早温服一钟。以少饭压之。一法。磁石火〔论〕本经别录甄权多以白石英色归于金而治肺病矣。夫五行中金为水母。而人身中金水又若互相子母者。然观二阴至肺。肾脉之由肺而至心也。俾火不刑金。而金为火妻。以布其气化。是则肺得司主气之职以益四脏者。岂不更藉于水哉。凡石为阴中之阳。兹种之由肾益肺者。盖又互相子母之义。有合于阴中之阳耳。别录云。治肺痿惟虚者始宜。如由热而成非可概予。至于肺痈吐脓咳逆。自为的对矣。苏颂曰。乳石论以钟乳为乳。白石英为石。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160138-5g1x681","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160138-5g1x681","updated":"20240614160138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是六英之贵惟白石也。又曰。乳者阳中之阴。石者阴中之阳。故阳生十一月后甲子服乳。阴生五月后甲子服石。然而相反畏恶。动则为害不浅。故乳石之发。方治虽多。罕有济者。诚不可轻饵也。盖金石悍气。有病则病当之。病去则阴气受之。不可不慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160138-r005nyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160138-r005nyh","updated":"20240614160138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕坩锅内火酒淬三次用。修治如法。中病即止。毋过剂焉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160146-vts5biw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160146-vts5biw"}},{"ID":"20240614160147-5jji535","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160147-5jji535","updated":"20240614160155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160147-0yk3rwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160147-0yk3rwc","updated":"20240614160147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"状如紫石英，但差，大而六棱，白色如水精。紫白二石英，当攻疾，可暂煮汁用，未闻久服之益。张仲景之意，只令 咀，不为细末者，岂无意焉。其久服，更宜详审。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160200-060c8ev","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160200-060c8ev"}},{"ID":"20240614160202-ayo8wye","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160202-ayo8wye","updated":"20240614160208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160202-yen8qj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160202-yen8qj5","updated":"20240614160202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘温，无毒。出泰山。以六棱莹白如水晶者为真。林北海先生《本草纲目必读》，但收紫而不及白，世鲜真者可知。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160202-6jvb9pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160202-6jvb9pq","updated":"20240614160202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》治消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气除风湿痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160202-rhqt7g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160202-rhqt7g3","updated":"20240614160202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英入手太阴、足阳明气分，肺痈溃久，痿痹不起者宜之。《本经》主消渴阴痿不足诸病，功专温肺无疑。但石性 悍，不可久服。仲景《金匮》风引汤只令碎如米粒，不欲其滓入胃也。《千金》五石等方，俱 过水飞入丸，而五石丸专以钟乳为君，合紫白石英、赤石脂、石膏，专温脏气，而石膏清胃，以解诸石之悍，且既经 过水飞，不虑其滓之留中蕴热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160213-e7zgu9o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160213-e7zgu9o"}},{"ID":"20240614160213-dw9pm3h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160213-dw9pm3h","updated":"20240614160217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160213-q0isj38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160213-q0isj38","updated":"20240614160213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温，温肺润燥，治肺痈溃久不敛，咳逆上气。细研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160245-heioi6z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160245-heioi6z"}},{"ID":"20240614160246-xyts6rt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160246-xyts6rt","updated":"20240614160251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160246-h1cughg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160246-h1cughg","updated":"20240614160246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温，润肺去燥，利小便，实大肠，治肺痿咳逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160256-f3z1i23","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160256-f3z1i23"}},{"ID":"20240614160257-byhxg2q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160257-byhxg2q","updated":"20240614160302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160257-kx7022o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160257-kx7022o","updated":"20240614160257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、辛，微温，无毒。主治消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹，治肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏，通日月光。久服轻身长年，耐寒热。生华阴山谷，及太山，大如指，长二、三寸，六面如削，白澈有光。其黄端白棱名黄石英，赤端名赤石英，青端名青石英，黑端名黑石英。二月采，亦无时。（恶马目毒公。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614160257-pm3tyx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160257-pm3tyx9","updated":"20240614160257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今医家用新安所出，极细长白澈者；寿阳八公山多大者，不正用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160233-n6axb6d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160233-n6axb6d"}},{"ID":"20240614160234-avbonof","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160234-avbonof","updated":"20240614160241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160234-i0wqezd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160234-i0wqezd","updated":"20240614160234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶马目毒公。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160234-qir05qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160234-qir05qi","updated":"20240614160234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘、辛、微温。入手太阴、阳明经气分。除风湿痿痹，疗寒气咳逆，利小便，治肺痈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160234-rf4jvv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160234-rf4jvv9","updated":"20240614160234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得朱砂，治惊悸。得磁石，治耳聋。 研，水飞用。久服、多服，则元气下陷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614160223-7j7lq8z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160223-7j7lq8z"}},{"ID":"20240614160225-gd62reu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160225-gd62reu","updated":"20240614160229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160225-obfccw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160225-obfccw6","updated":"20240614160225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平．入手足少阴阳明经．功专治痿痹肺痈．实大肠．利小便．得朱砂治惊悸．得磁石治耳聋．白如水晶者良．"}]},{"ID":"20240614160011-5yn777o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614160011-5yn777o"}},{"ID":"20240614160012-fy5hxbd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614160012-fy5hxbd","updated":"20240614160016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614160012-qu463t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160012-qu463t1","updated":"20240614160012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）散肺分寒燥不润"}]},{"ID":"20240614160012-crww2s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614160012-crww2s8","updated":"20240614160012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英（专入肺）。味甘而辛。性温无毒。按理似非润药湿药矣。而十剂偏指此属湿剂。谓枯则为燥。宜用白石英紫石英之属以湿之。不几令人眩惑乎？讵知书之言湿。有以湿为湿者。有以燥为湿者。以湿为湿。人易知。以燥为湿。人难明。兹而曰湿。是以燥以温为湿矣。（从温湿言。）石英性本辛温。辛则能以化液。温则能以滋润。故虽辛若湿。（因辛始湿。）是以寒燥不润之症。（燥从寒字点出。明甚。）得此辛以畅达。而滞不致见枯。此十剂所以以辛以温为湿而言也。书曰服此可治咳逆胸寒。消渴阴痿。风痹溺闭。肺痿肺痈。吐脓吐血等症。是亦辛温润肺之一验矣。但系石类。只可暂用。（颂论乳石。谓乳者阳中之阴。石者阴中之阳。故阳生十一月后甲子服乳。阴生五月后甲子服石。然而相反相恶。动则为害不浅。故乳石之发。方治虽多。而罕有济者。诚不可轻饵也。）凡服宜食冬瓜龙葵以压石气。忌芥菜蔓青芜夷葵荠 。白如水银者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155842-n7df1iu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155842-n7df1iu"}},{"ID":"20240614155923-1tx98fj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155923-1tx98fj","updated":"20240614155927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155923-7xaign9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155923-7xaign9","updated":"20240614155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘，微温，无毒。主治消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹。久服轻身长年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155923-9l1rshq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155923-9l1rshq","updated":"20240614155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（白石英始出华阴山谷及太山，今寿阳、泽州、虢州、洛州山中俱有。大如指，长二三寸，六面如削，白莹如玉而有光，长五六寸，益佳。或问天地开辟，草木始生，后人分移莳植。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155923-b38i93p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155923-b38i93p","updated":"20240614155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故他处亦有。今土中所生之石，亦有始生，与他处之分何耶？愚曰∶草木金石虫鱼皆为物类，始生者开辟之初，物之先见也。他处者，生育之广，物之繁盛也。天气从东南而西北，则草木始生东南者，未始不生西北，西北虽生，不如东南之力也。地气从西北而东南，则金石之始生西北者，未始不生东南，东南虽生，不如西北之力也。而岂莳植移徒之谓哉。若以草木土石而异视之，何所见之不大也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614155923-dsky6j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155923-dsky6j6","updated":"20240614155923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫白石英，品类相同，主治亦不甚远。紫为木火之色，气味甘温，故治心腹、肾脏之寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155842-oiozu59","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155842-oiozu59"}},{"ID":"20240614155912-tx19whc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155912-tx19whc","updated":"20240614155916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155912-xl8r9rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155912-xl8r9rh","updated":"20240614155912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重，润肺"}]},{"ID":"20240614155912-0nuvnjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155912-0nuvnjv","updated":"20240614155912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温。肺、大肠经气分之药。润以去燥，利小便，实大肠。治肺痿吐脓，咳逆上气。但系石类，祗可暂用（《十剂》曰∶湿可去枯，白石英、紫石英之属是也。湿，即润也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155912-pv7vwzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155912-pv7vwzt","updated":"20240614155912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶润药颇多，石药终燥，而徐之才取二石英为润剂，存其意可取）。白如水晶者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155842-3y9o5x9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155842-3y9o5x9"}},{"ID":"20240614155852-avhtwxw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155852-avhtwxw","updated":"20240614155900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155852-eiy88a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155852-eiy88a7","updated":"20240614155852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、辛，微温，无毒。主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹，疗肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏，通日月光。久服轻身长年，耐寒热。生华阴山谷，及太山，大如指，长二、三寸，六面如削，白澈有光。其黄端白棱名黄石英；赤端名赤石英；青端名青石英；黑端名黑石英。二月采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155852-h6xvo9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155852-h6xvo9h","updated":"20240614155852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶马目毒公。今医家用新安所出，极细长白澈者；寿阳八公山多大者，不正用之。《仙经》大小并有用，惟须精白无瑕杂者。如此说，则大者为佳。其四色英，今不复用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155852-4e9ty0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155852-4e9ty0z","updated":"20240614155852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕白虢州、洛州山中俱出虢州者大，径三、四寸，长五、六寸。今通以泽州者为胜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155842-prhfxs4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614155842-prhfxs4"}},{"ID":"20240614155843-9mmgr0m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614155843-9mmgr0m","updated":"20240614155848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白石英《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614155843-51wn8ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155843-51wn8ig","updated":"20240614155843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。性微温。无毒。禀金气以生。降也。阴中阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155843-8alvoju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155843-8alvoju","updated":"20240614155843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主消渴。阴痿不足。咳逆。胸膈间久寒。益气。除风湿痹。（本经）疗肺痿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155843-mezsxii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155843-mezsxii","updated":"20240614155843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614155843-0ohdi89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614155843-0ohdi89","updated":"20240614155843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】入肺大肠二经。为润燥之品。（二经气分药）【前论】寇氏曰。紫白二石英攻疾。可暂煮汁用。未闻久服之益。仲景只为咀。不为细但【炮制】雷公曰。凡使白石英。取白如水晶。状若紫石英而差大。六棱者。用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175513-nu4x466","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606175513-nu4x466"}},{"ID":"20240606175514-2l6uvpv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-2l6uvpv","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：白石英"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-wmemhe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-wmemhe0","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-k8slj2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-k8slj2p","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bái Shí Yīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-9acqtaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-9acqtaz","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-tqmc4i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-tqmc4i5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为一种块状的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二氧化硅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"矿石。全年可采挖，拣选纯白色的供用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-78teitx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-78teitx","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-vtgwt4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-vtgwt4e","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 呈不规则的块状，多具棱角，大小不一。全体呈白色或乳白色，有的微带黄色。表面不平坦而光滑，有脂肪样光泽。质极坚硬，体重，破而不平齐，边缘较锋利，可划刻玻璃。无臭，无味。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-7wo7jx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-7wo7jx2","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-ugxjl42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-ugxjl42","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"煅白石英"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取净白石英，打碎，置坩锅或其他容器内，在无烟的炉火中煅至红透，倒入醋盆中淬酥，反复2次，取出晾凉，用时捣碎即得（每100斤用醋20～30斤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-529qykh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-529qykh","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-121dqb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-121dqb8","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-3j6775l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-3j6775l","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-qleu6j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-qleu6j5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 镇静安神，止咳，降逆。用于惊悸不安，咳嗽气逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-ducmu0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-ducmu0e","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-gbtz0gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-gbtz0gg","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～4钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-egz3ffk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-egz3ffk","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-d8l7stx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-d8l7stx","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）历代有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫石英"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入血份，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白石英"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入气份之说。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-5bw3fgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-5bw3fgn","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-8cx14se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-8cx14se","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-rbnw07v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-rbnw07v","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：白石英"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-1913e2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-1913e2x","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-j7o7eog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-j7o7eog","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bái Shí Yīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-nlx49nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-nlx49nj","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-hveqvli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-hveqvli","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-45t3zsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-45t3zsa","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-mgcphon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-mgcphon","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为氧化物类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石英"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的矿石。采得后，拣选纯白的石英。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-1cc7lxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-1cc7lxt","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-00eoced","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-00eoced","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产江苏、广东、湖北、河北、福建、陕西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-38d9g0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-38d9g0j","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-e0h8xid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-e0h8xid","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石英（《纲目》）三方晶系。晶体呈六方柱状，柱体晶面上有水平的条纹，也常呈晶簇状、粒状等集合体产出。颜色为无色或白色，由于所含杂质关系，晶体常呈各种不同的颜色，以浅红、烟色、紫色等为常见。条痕白色。结晶体显玻璃光泽，块状体呈油状光泽，光泽强度不一。透明至半透明，也有不透明者。断口贝壳状，或不平坦状参差状。硬度7。比重2.65。性脆。具焦热电性及压电性。完整的晶体产于岩石晶洞中，块状的常产于热液矿脉中；也是花岗岩、片麻岩、砂岩等各种岩石的重要组成部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-klp66ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-klp66ox","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-0if4obo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-0if4obo","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为不规则的块状，多具棱角，大小不一。全体呈白色或乳白色，有的微带黄色。表面不平坦而光滑，透明至不透明，具玻璃光泽或脂肪光泽。质坚硬而重，砸断面不整齐，边缘较锋利，可刻划玻璃。无气味。以色白、明洁、有光泽、无杂色、杂质者为佳。溶于氢氟酸，不溶于其他酸，但可溶于强碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-f74vea5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-f74vea5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上海及北京地区所用的白石英为水晶。水晶与白石英为同一矿物，即石英无色透明的结晶体。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-zadicsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-zadicsu","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-6m6yyjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-6m6yyjy","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含二氧化硅（SiO2），其中Si53.3％，O46.7％；此外，尚含有不同的杂质，如A1+++，Fe+++，Na+，K+等。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-0z79jy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-0z79jy3","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-nux6322","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-nux6322","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 白石英：洗净，晒干，砸碎。煅白石英：取净白石英砸碎，入坩埚内，置无烟的炉火中煅红，取出，放凉，研细。亦有醋煅者，将白石英置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅至红透，倾入醋中淬酥，取出再煅淬一次，晾干。（每白石英100斤，用醋20斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-opvg62o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-opvg62o","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《医学入门》：\"白石英，火煅醋淬七次，水飞用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-n2i02bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-n2i02bm","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-nn3rs2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-nn3rs2g","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肺、肾、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-esfl74s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-esfl74s","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草蒙筌》：\"入肺经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-tj8s1fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-tj8s1fy","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"手太阴、阳明气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-diyp9m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-diyp9m5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草撮要》：\"入手足少阴、阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-b2fbkm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-b2fbkm8","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-g6hgdyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-g6hgdyp","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-nzuby9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-nzuby9k","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-r1x5qzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-r1x5qzb","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"歧伯、黄帝、雷公、扁鹘：无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-c2iertb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-c2iertb","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"辛，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-ui83x01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-ui83x01","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-u6408fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-u6408fg","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-2dprb4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-2dprb4k","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经集注》：\"恶马目毒公。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-awaz22n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-awaz22n","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"忌芥菜、蔓菁、芜荑、葵、荠苨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-apavata","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-apavata","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《得配本草》：\"久服多服则元气下陷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-tk0et0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-tk0et0q","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-5et64xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-5et64xz","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肺肾，安心神，利小便。治肺寒咳喘，阳痿，消渴，心神不安，惊悸善忘，小便不利，黄疸，石水，风寒湿痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-r75okdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-r75okdf","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆（一作’呕逆’），胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-8m2ohj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-8m2ohj3","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-d3t8xik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-d3t8xik","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"能治肺痈吐脓，治嗽逆上气，疸黄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-1yfmyzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-1yfmyzx","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④王好古：\"实大肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-vb4h1dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-vb4h1dg","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-k7jpmlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-k7jpmlj","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-couvj2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-couvj2s","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-pt70rnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-pt70rnn","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治形寒饮冷，肺气冲逆，作咳作喘，或为哮呛，或为冷怯：白石英二两，日煎防饮，一月平复。（《青囊秘方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-jwvc4py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-jwvc4py","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治肺虚少气，补虚羸，益肺，止嗽，进饮食：白石英一分（杵细者，绵裹），五味子、白茯苓、附子、人参各半钱，甘草一字。上为粗末，用水五大盏，银石器中煮石英至三盏，投药再煎至一盏半，去滓。分二服，空心晚食前或鸡鸣拂旦服。（《鸡峰普济方》白石英汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-oaphgbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-oaphgbm","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治肾腋阳气衰微，津源不能上济于华池，频作渴者：白石英四两，煎汤饮。或加枸杞子二两同煎.（《青囊秘方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-70kwn84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-70kwn84","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治心脏不安，惊悸善忘，上膈风热化痰：白石英一两，朱砂一两。同研为散。每服半钱，食后夜卧，金、银汤调下。（《简要济众方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-rdrl5y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-rdrl5y8","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治五劳七伤，羸瘦，体热心烦，小便不利，夜多恍惚：白石英五两（炼成粉者），干地黄二两，白茯苓二两，人参三两（去芦头），天门冬五两（去心，焙），地骨皮二两。上药捣罗为末，入石英粉研令匀，炼蜜和捣五，七百杵，丸如梧桐子大。每服，不计时候，煎黄耆汤下三十丸。（《圣惠方》白石英丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-etp49ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-etp49ce","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治腹坚胀满，世号石水：白石英十两，明净者。捶如大豆大，以瓷瓶盛，用好酒二斗浸，以泥重封瓶口，以马粪及糠火烧之，长令酒小沸，从卯至午即住火。日可三度，暖一中盏次之。如不饮酒，即随性少饮之。其白石英，可更一度烧用。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-d351apb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-d351apb","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治风虚冷痹，诸阳不足，及肾虚耳聋，益精保神：㈠白石英三两，坩埚内火煅酒淬三次，入瓶中密封，勿泄气。每早温服一钟，以少饭压之。㈡磁石（火煅醋淬五次）、白石英各五两。绢袋盛，浸一升酒中五、六日。温服，将尽更添酒。（《千金翼方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-h3w5uyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-h3w5uyf","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-w87g573","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-w87g573","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-5yjjzbm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-5yjjzbm","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：白石英"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-q12l8sj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-q12l8sj","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-qhpxwnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-qhpxwnw","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bái Shí Yīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-6tbu7ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-6tbu7ao","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-c1aii7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-c1aii7w","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Quartz"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-epjoj6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-epjoj6q","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-s20ewfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-s20ewfu","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《本经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-wdlt9ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-wdlt9ah","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《吴普本草》：白石英，生太山。形如紫石英，白泽，长者二、三寸。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-3tihdq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-3tihdq8","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：白石英，生华阴山谷及太山。大如指，长二、三寸，六面如削，白澈有光。二月采，亦无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-ug510oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-ug510oz","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.陶弘景：今医家用新安所出，极细长白澈者。寿阳八公山，多大者，惟须精白无瑕杂者。如此说，则大者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-bdpxtw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-bdpxtw0","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《唐本草》：白石英，所在皆有，今泽州、虢州、洛州山中俱出。虢州者大，径三、"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-43zzz64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-43zzz64","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-uugkyge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-uugkyge","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为氧化物类矿物石英的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-2q3ngjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-2q3ngjr","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Quartz"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-1dwaalo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-1dwaalo","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采得后，拣选纯白的石英。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-o8ozn12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-o8ozn12","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-q3ayi2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-q3ayi2u","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：完整的晶体产于岩石晶洞中，块状的常产于热液矿脉中：也是花岗岩、片麻岩、砂岩等各种岩石的重要组成部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-fjblype","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-fjblype","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产江苏、广东、湖北、福建、陕西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-0pyj7jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-0pyj7jl","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-cta0sl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-cta0sl3","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 三方晶系。晶体呈六方柱状，柱体晶面上有水平的条纹，也常呈晶簇状、粒状等集合体产出。颜色为无色或白色，由于所含杂质关系，晶体常呈各种不同的颜色，以浅红、烟色、紫色等为常见。条痕白色。结晶体显玻璃光泽，块状体呈油状光泽，光泽强度不一。透明至半透明，也有不透明者。断口贝壳状，或不平坦状参差状。硬度7。比重2.65。性脆。具焦热电性及压电性。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-2743mq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-2743mq9","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-dp9egm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-dp9egm9","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为六方柱状或粗粒状集合体，呈不规则块状，多具棱角而锋利。白色或淡灰白色；条痕白色。表面不平坦，半透明至不透明，具脂肪样光泽。体重，质坚硬，可刻划玻璃成划痕；砸碎后，断面不平坦。气微，味淡。以色白、明洁、无杂色、杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-c1sg9u1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-c1sg9u1","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 (1)本品细碎屑白色。用水合氯醛装置，置显微镜下观察，无色透明，可见到断面以受力点为圆心的同心圆波纹，似贝壳状，或不具同心圆纹呈次贝壳状。(2)透射偏光镜下，薄片中无色透明。低正突起。表面光滑，无糙面现象。见不到解理。最高干涉色为Ⅰ级黄白色。波状消光。一轴晶。正光性。折射率No＝1.544，Ne＝1.553。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-m4fbty2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-m4fbty2","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志 杂质检查限制 据《江苏省中药材标准》1989年版规定：①碳酸盐：本品细粉遇稀盐酸，不得发生二氧化碳气泡。②酸碱度：本品细粉加新沸过冷水振摇后的滤液，加甲基红指示液或酚酞指示液，均不得显红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-bwezafb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-bwezafb","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-cjxyl9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-cjxyl9s","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主含二氧化硅(SiO2)，其中硅约占53.3%，氧约占46.7%；尚含微量铝、铁、钠、钾等。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-thvoxtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-thvoxtm","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-sp2dta7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-sp2dta7","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.白石英：洗净，晒干，砸碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-4rgeho4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-4rgeho4","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.煅白石英：取净白石英砸碎，入坩埚内，置无烟的炉火中煅红，取出，放凉，研细。亦有醋煅者，将白石英置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅至红透，倾入醋中淬酥，取出再煅淬一次，晾干。(每白石英100斤，用醋20斤)3.《医学入门》：白石英，火煅醋淬七次，水飞用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-f1u2nou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-f1u2nou","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-8iy7y8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-8iy7y8a","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品细粉适量，加等量无水碳酸钠，充分混合均匀，用铂金耳取小量，置火焰上灼烧，形成玻璃状透明体，有时内部含有气泡。（检查二氧化硅）X射线衍射分析曲线：石英4.23(8),3.33(\u003e10),2.45(2),2.23(1)。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-p51hf9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-p51hf9c","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-fo71k7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-fo71k7n","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；肾；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-atpj077","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-atpj077","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-fkl4qgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-fkl4qgq","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；辛；温；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-rfg1vjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-rfg1vjt","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-lxqayf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-lxqayf8","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《得配本草》：久服多服则元气下陷。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-c1gjhcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-c1gjhcr","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-0j6ueu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-0j6ueu5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 温肺肾；安心神；利小便。主肺寒咳喘；阳痿；消渴；心神不安；惊悸善忘；小便不利；黄疸；石水；风寒湿痹"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-av4a8li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-av4a8li","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-av8jol5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-av8jol5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-5钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-9cccpfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-9cccpfe","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-pq2yr1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-pq2yr1f","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肺汤《圣济总录》；白石英汤《鸡峰普济方》；白石英汤《圣济总录》；生地黄汤《圣济总录》"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-wfdn21u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-wfdn21u","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-h5qu8qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-h5qu8qg","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《药对》：湿可去枯，即紫石英、白石英之属是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-gh4ngqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-gh4ngqm","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草衍义》：紫、白二石英，当攻疾，可暂煮汁用，未闻久服之益。张仲景(风引汤)之意，只令fu咀，不为细末者，岂无意焉。其久服，更宜详审。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-cqxox06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-cqxox06","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草备要》：按湿即润也。润药颇多，石药终燥，而徐之才取二石英为润剂，存其意可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-94dyrw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-94dyrw5","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经》：主消渴，阴痿不足，咳逆(一作呕逆)，胸膈间久寒，益气，除风湿痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-4i91ce0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-4i91ce0","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《别录》：疗肺痿，下气，利小便，补五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-elsfd9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-elsfd9d","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药性论》：能治肺痈吐脓，治嗽逆上气，疸黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-hr493wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-hr493wt","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.王好古：实大肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-8t687ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-8t687ty","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240606175514-q2wfpy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175514-q2wfpy7","updated":"20240606175514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606175516-908meck","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606175516-908meck"}},{"ID":"20240606175517-h1d8z54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606175517-h1d8z54"}}]}